  unitName: Dryad
  unitId: 30092
  unitNumber: 115
  description: A powerful spirit that lives in deep forests. Dryads live in large,
    ancient trees and are extremely timid. They dislike combat and excel at support
    magic. Sometimes, as a prank, they enslave people with magic and bend them to
    their will. For ages, youths who disappeared in the forest have been said to
    have become the slaves of Dryads.
  summonDesc: Are you the one who's lost,<br>or perhaps is it me!?<br>You're staying
    until you answer.
  fusionDesc: Hehe...<br>Is that all you<br>have to say?
